<title>USA: Dlr/yen hits 127 in US, highest since August 1992.</title>
<headline>Dlr/yen hits 127 in US, highest since August 1992.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The dollar rose to its highest level against the yen since August 1992, trading at 127.00 yen in late U.S. trade, dealers said.</p>
<p>A dealer at Sanwa Bank Ltd in New York confirmed that the dollar traded hands at 127.</p>
<p>Earlier, the dollar rose to 1.7270 marks, its highest level since February 1994.</p>
</text>
